        Evaluating and Improving Large Language <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> for Competitive Program <span class="search-hit mathjax">Generation</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wei%2C+M">Minnan Wei</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+Z">Ziming Li</a>, 
      
