    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Performance Measurements in the AI-Centric Computing Continuum Systems
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Donta%2C+P+K">Praveen Kumar Donta</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+Q">Qiyang Zhang</a>, 
      
