        &hellip;-morphisms has a cofibrantly <span class="search-hit mathjax">generated</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">model</span> structure. In this <span class="search-hit mathjax">model</span> structure every object is fibrant and the cofibrant objects have cofibrant morphisms. As a consequence we prove that the semi-free A$_\infty$-categories (resp. resolutions) are cofibrant objects (resp. resoluti&hellip;
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('2506.22847v1-abstract-full').style.display = 'inline'; document.getElementById('2506.22847v1-abstract-short').style.display = 'none';">&#9661; More</a>
      </span>
      <span class="abstract-full has-text-grey-dark mathjax" id="2506.22847v1-abstract-full" style="display: none;">
        We prove that the category of (strictly unital) A$_\infty$-categories, linear over a commutative ring $R$, with strict A$_\infty$-morphisms has a cofibrantly <span class="search-hit mathjax">generated</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">model</span> structure. In this <span class="search-hit mathjax">model</span> structure every object is fibrant and the cofibrant objects have cofibrant morphisms. As a consequence we prove that the semi-free A$_\infty$-categories (resp. resolutions) are cofibrant objects (resp. resolution) in this <span class="search-hit mathjax">model</span> structure.
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('2506.22847v1-abstract-full').style.display = 'none'; document.getElementById('2506.22847v1-abstract-short').style.display = 'inline';">&#9651; Less</a>
